            "text": "{\"title\":\"Brazilian Sweet Cassava and Spiced Coconut Milk Dessert Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":45,\"servings\":6,\"summary\":\"This traditional \u003cb\u003eBrazilian sweet cassava stew\u003c/b\u003e offers a decadent twist on classic regional home cooking. Originating as a comforting end to festive dinners in Northeastern Brazil, this dish features tender roots braised softly in a luscious spiced bath. Soft chunks of cassava absorb rich flavor from creamy \u003cb\u003ecoconut milk\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003econdensed milk\u003c/b\u003e, punctuated by warm notes of ground cinnamon, cloves, and vanilla extract. As the stew simmers slowly, starch from the roots naturally thickens the aromatic broth into a velvety custard-like sauce that coats every spoonful. Finished with freshly grated coconut and toasted cashew nuts for a delightful textural contrast, this sweet dessert stew balances rich tropical aromas with comforting home-cooked rustic flair. Serve this dish warm during cool evenings or chill it in small dessert bowls for a refreshing after-dinner treat during warm summer gatherings. It represents a memorable celebration of native Brazilian tubers transformed into a sophisticated dessert classic.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":420,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":18,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":13,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":65},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":62,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":34,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":10},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":15,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":5},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":120,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":5},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":4,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":16},{\